---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import PageFooter from '../components/PageFooter.astro';
import Medallion from '../components/Medallion.astro';
import Ornament from '../components/Ornament.astro';
import fig3Svg from '../../public/sketches/fig-3-verdict-loop.svg?raw';

const mcpHttp = `{
  "mcpServers": {
    "unitares": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "http://localhost:8767/mcp/"
    }
  }
}`;

const loop = `session = start_session(force_new=True)
sid = session["client_session_id"]

result = sync_state(
    response_text="Implemented the requested change and verified the build.",
    complexity=0.6,
    client_session_id=sid,
)

action = result["state_summary"]["action"]
reason = result["action_summary"]["reason"]
next_step = result["next_action"]`;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Build on UNITARES — CIRWEL Systems"
  description="A concise, verified path to run UNITARES, connect an MCP client, and use identity, evidence, memory, policy, and coordination."
>
  <PageHeader currentPath="/build" />

  <main class="px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-screen-xl mx-auto">
    <section class="pt-14 pb-20 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-24 border-b border-sepia/50">
      <p class="label text-oxblood mb-6">Build</p>
      <h1 class="display text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl !leading-[1.08] mb-8 max-w-4xl">Run UNITARES.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-stone max-w-3xl">Run the server, connect an existing client, and let each piece of work return an attributed record with a reason and a next step.</p>
      <Ornament size="floret" class="mt-10 opacity-80" />
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">I · Run</p>
        <Medallion roman="I" class="hidden lg:block mt-7 mb-8" />
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">Use a verified release.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-lg text-stone leading-relaxed mb-7">UNITARES is self-hosted. The release below starts the server and its storage services on your machine.</p>
        <div class="runcmd mb-6"><span class="prompt">$</span><span class="cmd">gh repo clone CIRWEL/unitares -- --branch v2.22.1</span></div>
        <div class="runcmd mb-6"><span class="prompt">$</span><span class="cmd">cd unitares &amp;&amp; docker compose up -d --wait</span></div>
        <div class="runcmd"><span class="prompt">$</span><span class="cmd">curl http://localhost:8767/health</span></div>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone mt-5">The repository README identifies the current verified release. Check it before copying the tag into an automated install.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-t border-sepia/50 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">II · Connect</p>
        <Medallion roman="II" class="hidden lg:block mt-7 mb-8" />
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">Keep your current client.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-lg text-stone leading-relaxed mb-7">Any client that speaks Streamable HTTP MCP can use the same local endpoint. Nothing at the boundary assumes a model vendor.</p>
        <pre class="codeplate mb-7"><code>{mcpHttp}</code></pre>
        <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Codex, Claude Code, Cursor, Goose, Hermes, hosted connectors, and custom hosts can all connect through their existing MCP configuration. Non-MCP callers use <span class="font-mono text-sm">/v1/tools/call</span>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-t border-sepia/50 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">III · Work</p>
        <Medallion roman="III" class="hidden lg:block mt-7 mb-8" />
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">Read the reason and proceed.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 max-w-3xl">
        <pre class="codeplate mb-7"><code>{loop}</code></pre>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <article><p class="label text-oxblood mb-3">Action</p><p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Proceed, guide, or pause describes the current policy response.</p></article>
          <article><p class="label text-oxblood mb-3">Reason</p><p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">The response explains what evidence or boundary produced the action.</p></article>
          <article><p class="label text-oxblood mb-3">Next step</p><p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">The agent receives something useful to do rather than a verdict alone.</p></article>
        </div>
        <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed mt-8">Add <span class="font-mono text-sm">confidence</span> only when the agent is deliberately making a prediction. When the result becomes known, <span class="font-mono text-sm">record_result</span> connects the outcome to that prediction.</p>
        <figure class="mt-12 figure-svg" role="img" aria-label="The UNITARES action, reason, next-step, and result loop."><Fragment set:html={fig3Svg} /></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-t border-sepia/50 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">IV · Extend</p>
        <Medallion roman="IV" class="hidden lg:block mt-7 mb-8" />
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">Build against the contract.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 max-w-3xl">
        <div class="runcmd mb-7"><span class="prompt">$</span><span class="cmd">pip install unitares-sdk</span></div>
        <p class="text-lg text-stone leading-relaxed mb-6">The SDK gives long-running services and custom agents the public identity, evidence, memory, policy, heartbeat, and coordination interfaces without importing CIRWEL’s deployment.</p>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/cirwel/unitares/blob/master/docs/manual/README.md" class="label text-oxblood no-underline hover:underline">Read the operations manual →</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-t border-sepia/50 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4"><p class="label text-oxblood">V · Where it fits</p><Medallion roman="V" class="hidden lg:block mt-7" /></div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8">
        <dl class="max-w-3xl">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 py-5 border-t border-sepia/50"><dt class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-3 display text-xl">Evals</dt><dd class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-9 text-stone">Ask whether a model or system can perform a defined task.</dd></div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 py-5 border-t border-sepia/50"><dt class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-3 display text-xl">Guardrails</dt><dd class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-9 text-stone">Decide whether a particular action is allowed and contained.</dd></div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 py-5 border-y border-oxblood"><dt class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-3 display text-xl">UNITARES</dt><dd class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-9">Keep identity, evidence, understanding, and next actions connected while work continues.</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mt-8">UNITARES does not determine whether an output is correct or ethical, and external effects remain under the host’s control. Its deployed mechanisms are exercised in CIRWEL’s environment; independent outcome benefit remains a research question.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <PageFooter />
</BaseLayout>
